，但他的打下的基础\n已经足够我们随时卷土重来。\n&向宠\n哼，果然还是东吴的暗助吧。\n&李歆\n是又如何？但是如果你们没有歧视南中人\n，没有压迫他们，东吴再怎么帮助我们\n又有什么用？\n&李歆\n乖乖等死吧，只要能够阵斩名将向宠，\n我们义军马上就会名震天下。�U�C"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,36,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,22,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,16,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,2,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张嶷\n德信你看那边！\n&马忠\n向将军的军队居然被打到只剩下这样？\n过去夷陵之战他明明可以让部队毫发\n无伤的。\n&关索\n此一时彼一时，现在他面对的对手是和\n陆逊完全不同，不喜思考，凭著感觉作\n战的战斗民族。\n&关索\n用正规兵法很难取胜，必须要改变思考\n方式才行。\n&杨兰\n过去丞相七擒孟获据说不也靠兵法取胜？\n&马忠\n嗯…其实那些故事都是我和孟获编的，\n南中版本还是丞相被俘三次…\n&张嶷\n我也很委屈呀，在那故事里，我还被祝融\n两口飞刀射下来当俘虏，明明现实中是我\n一把把对方抓下来。\n&马忠\n给南中人一些面子，让祝融成为他们的\n偶像对我们反而更有益处。\n&杨兰\n喂！我们怎么聊开了？救人要紧吧。\n&马忠\n对对！现在全力抢救向宠将军。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[847,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&李歆\n碍事的家伙，预备部队出击！"]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,416,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,417,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,418,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,419,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&南蛮兵5\n没有这么容易的啦！\n&南蛮兵6\n李将军早就把你们的行军路径摸得\n一清二楚的啦。\n&张嶷\n光凭这点人就可以挡住我？五部飞军，\n所当无前！\n&南蛮兵5\n哼，南中人的叛徒想对抗真正的南中人？"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[847,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1015]]},"end":60},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑歼灭所有敌军。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑马忠死亡。\n二﹑回合数超过30。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1015],[]]},"end":63},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑歼灭所有敌军。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑马忠死亡。\n二、向宠死亡\n三﹑回合数超过30。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1015]]},"end":66},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑歼灭所有敌军。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1015],[]]},"end":69},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑援救向宠。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印绶条件\n一、让马忠接触向宠。\n二、对话和单挑全部触发。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":13425,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":13427,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,242,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,20,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":13532,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,9,15]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[20]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[89,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[20,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":13613,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[3,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[188]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,20,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&花鬘\n追著关索的气息居然追到这里来，这里\n不是老爸的辖区，好像有点不妙的啦。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,16,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,20,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[16,3,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n咦？！你怎么追到这里来了？\n&花鬘\n好啊关索，五年前你不告而别，听说又\n回去成都找你的星彩，我这次不宰了你\n才怪的啦！\n&关索\n不…不是这样的…我是因为参加对东吴\n和对抗曹贼的战争才…\n&花鬘\n嗯…等一下！你身边那个姑娘又是谁？\n&关索\n她是…\n&杨兰\n关索哥哥，那个女人是谁呀？好可怕喔。\n&关索\n喂！不要在这个紧要关头整我！\n&花鬘\n关索…你想要选择什么样的死法？秃龙洞\n有四个泉任你挑选。\n&关索\n拜托你，现在正在打仗你没看到吗？可以\n等到打完仗再来找我算帐吗？\n&花鬘\n好吧，但是之后你最好有所觉悟。\n&张嶷\n（女人真可怕，幸好内人很温柔贤淑。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[203,49]]},"end":14},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[847,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&李歆\n喂！你这女人是怎么回事？在战场上打情\n骂俏的，你当我李歆是死人呀？\n&李歆\n给我扁死那个臭女人。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&花鬘\n关你什么事！现在老娘心情非常不好，\n想找死吗？"]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[0,847,0,0,0,0,6,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[188,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":14655,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[36,242,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[40,1015]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[36,242,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[242,36,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n向将军你没事吧？\n&向宠\n原来是德信…我实在是惭愧…这场战争\n几乎让我军全灭了…\n&向宠\n我也伤重至此，已经是回天乏术了…\n&马忠\n你是国家的珍宝，如果你死了，请问谁来\n保护圣上的安全？\n&向宠\n关于这点我也只能请求你帮忙了…\n&马忠\n别这样说丧气话！"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[242,9,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&向宠\n叔父…我恐怕没办法回去见您了。\n&马忠\n向将军？！\n&向宠\n丞相曾经夸我性行淑均，晓畅军事，现在\n看来…丞相似乎看走眼了。\n&向宠\n这些东西我已经用不上了，就给你吧。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[98,0,1,36]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[100,0,1,36]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[99,0,1,36]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,242,0,0,0,0,65535,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n唉…我大汉损失了这样的栋梁之才。"]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,244,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,524,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,525,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,526,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,527,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&黄方\n呵呵呵，打死名将向宠，我南中人抗暴的\n声威将达到顶峰的啦。\n&黄方\n现在的局面，纵然诸葛亮重生也无法挽回\n的啦。\n&黄方\n现在汉嘉起义，明天越隽起义，过不久整\n个蜀地将被我南中人的怒火所攻陷的啦。\n&黄方\n啊…我们南中人就是悲情，从秦以来就被\n这些无耻的汉人欺负压榨，侵夺本来属于\n我们的生存空间的啦。\n&黄方\n而更悲哀的是，甚至有像李恢那样的南奸\n，出卖我们南中，帮汉人欺负我们的啦。\n&黄方\n这么悲情的我们更要团结，大家携手一起\n打倒万恶的汉人的啦！\n&南蛮骑3\n打倒汉人的啦！\n&南蛮骑4\n黄方大元帅万岁的啦！\n&黄方\n（科科科，学你们南中人的语调就可以轻\n松骗到你们南中人，难怪老爹过去说过，\n语言是最好的工具。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n油嘴滑舌真令人讨厌，我要亲自扯掉他的\n臭嘴。\n&花鬘\n这个人说的也不是没有道理，南中人平常\n被汉人压迫的仇恨可是很深的啦。\n&花鬘\n万一爆发起来，汉人必定为了平乱而疲于\n奔命。\n&马忠\n南中人和汉人之间的仇恨，到什么时候才\n能化解？\n&张嶷\n（要是能够让南中人的恨意集中到我身上\n，德信统治南中应该也会顺利一点吧。）\n&关索\n难怪我最近很难泡到南中出身的妹妹，原\n来是因为他…\n&花鬘\n关索！\n&杨兰\n低级！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["达成印绶条件\n让马忠接触向宠。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[97,0,1,36]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[40,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":16476,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[36,242,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1015],[47]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[36,242,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[242,36,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n向将军你没事吧？\n&向宠\n原来是德信…我实在是惭愧…这场战争\n几乎让我军全灭了…\n&向宠\n我也伤重至此，已经是回天乏术了…\n&马忠\n你是国家的珍宝，如果你死了，请问谁来\n保护圣上的安全？\n&向宠\n关于这点我也只能请求你帮忙了…\n&马忠\n别这样说丧气话！"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[242,9,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&向宠\n叔父…我恐怕没办法回去见您了。\n&马忠\n向将军？！\n&向宠\n丞相曾经夸我性行淑均，晓畅军事，现在\n看来…丞相似乎看走眼了。\n&向宠\n这些东西我已经用不上了，就给你吧。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[98,0,1,36]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[100,0,1,36]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[99,0,1,36]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,242,0,0,0,0,65535,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n唉…我大汉损失了这样的栋梁之才。"]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,244,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,524,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,525,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,526,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,527,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op