\n都没有做。\n&黄方\n现在南中人对你们的怨恨，就算用政治也\n无法解决。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[41,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":19044,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[20,847,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[49]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,847,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[847,20,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":22},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[20,847,18]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"臭女人，现在就让你闭嘴！",10]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"你办得到就来呀！",9]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,8]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"看招！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,8]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"来吧！",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,2,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"怎、怎么可能……\n怎么会有这种事！\n哇啊啊～！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,11]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,6]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"不堪一击，只会出张嘴。",1]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&李歆\n怎么可能？！放…放开我！"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,847,0,0,0,0,6,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[49,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":19557,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[20,244,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[42]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[20,244,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[244,20,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&花鬘\n搞成这样血流成河，不就和我老爸当年\n起兵犯下的错误一样的啦？\n&黄方\n你老爸孟获本来就不是纯正的南中人，\n他投靠我们南中人的敌人更是出卖南中。\n&花鬘\n你也不是南中人！还敢说我老爸？！\n&黄方\n这里的人相信我是南中人，我就是真正\n的南中人。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[42,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":19907,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[2,244,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[43,1015]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,244,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[244,2,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&杨兰\n不断灌输那些人悲情，到底对你有什么\n好处？\n&黄方\n羌人？你们羌人受到的待遇不会比我们\n南中人好到哪去，居然还帮那些汉人。\n&黄方\n真可悲，如果合我们羌人和南中人的力量\n早就可以推翻这剥削我们的恶鬼政府。\n&杨兰\n你说够了没？就算要合作也不会找你这种\n长舌公。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":52},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[2,244,18]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"既然这么会说，你的实力又如何？",10]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"糟糕…刚才嘴炮打太爽，有点后悔了。",8]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"嗯嗯？",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,8]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"哇哈哈！\n别以为我黄方大元帅好对付！",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"就这样？",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"怎、怎么可能…？\n一定是弄错了！\n再吃我一招！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,4,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"人﹑人呢？\n人到哪去了？",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,8]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"真是差劲，这种实力就想推翻大汉？",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"哼，就算杀了我黄方，还会有千千万万个\n黄方！",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"只要汉人继续他们的暴政，灭亡之日就\n指日可待。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"哼！",0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"哇啊啊啊～……！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[38,1]},{"op":98,"name":"duel_62","args":[1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"究竟是黄方造成这次的暴乱，还是这次\n暴乱造就了黄方，我都快搞不清楚了。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"过去我眼睛看到魏国对我们的暴行，莫非\n在这里也是持续著？",1]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&黄方\n南中尊严万岁！别以为我死了，南中人和\n汉人的战争就会结束。"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,244,0,0,0,0,65535,1]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[102,0,1,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马忠\n黄方已死，这下敌兵可是群龙无首。"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[2,65535,0,0,0,19,19,2,1,0,10,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[43,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":21494,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[2,244,1]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,1,2,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1015],[46]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[2,244,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"un